WEBVTT

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:02.750
<v><b>Male Speaker 1:</b></v> I<b>’m seeing</b> an old friend tonight.

00:00:04.681 --> 00:00:06.380
<v><b>Female Speaker 1:</b></v> She<b>’s arriving</b> at lunchtime.

00:00:08.349 --> 00:00:10.240
<v><b>Male Speaker 2:</b></v> She <b>isn’t leaving</b> until Friday.

00:00:12.197 --> 00:00:14.445
<v><b>Female Speaker 2:</b></v> They <b>aren’t coming</b> to the party tomorrow.

00:00:16.447 --> 00:00:17.931
<v><b>Male Speaker 3:</b></v> What <b>are</b> you <b>doing</b> this evening?

00:00:19.849 --> 00:00:21.712
<v><b>Female Speaker 3:</b></v> <b>Is</b> he <b>meeting</b> us at the restaurant?